# scripts
./config/**

# FSC Lab custom USD assets - large binaries (100s of MB), not meant to go into git. Distributed
# out-of-band (currently Google Drive) instead. Deliberately scoped to our own extension/app
# asset dirs only - does NOT touch the upstream extensions/pegasus.simulator/.../assets/ tree,
# whose small demo USD files stay tracked in git as-is.
extensions/fsc_aerial_manipulation/**/assets/
application/robotic_arm/assets/
# Recorded flight data from the whole-body simulation campaigns. One .npz is a
# full run's odometry + 89-channel control debug at 250 Hz, so a campaign
# directory is 50-125 MB and the four of them plus results/ come to ~355 MB.
# The FIGURES, LOGS and analysis notes beside them ARE tracked (~4.5 MB total)
# because they are what the write-ups cite; the raw arrays are regenerable by
# re-flying, and are distributed out-of-band like the USD assets above.
*.npz
